wsl2-arm64
wsl2-x86
qemu-uboot-arm64
qemu-uboot-x86
qemu-uefi-x86
qemu-uefi-arm64
thinkpad-x13s
xiaomi-elish
oneplus-kebab
ayn-odin2
mekotronics-r58hd
mekotronics-r58-4x4
retroidpocket-rp5
retroidpocket-rpmini
orangepi5-ultra

# Superseded by the unified "friendlyelec-rk3588" image (armbian/build#10946),
# which covers these boards plus M6V2/T6-LTS-Plus via runtime SARADC
# detection. Kept as independent, unmodified board configs in armbian/build
# (not sourcing the unified one) per discussion on #10946 - this blacklist
# only stops CI from publishing new builds under their old slugs; the
# board_slug-level download pages migrate to armbian.github.io's reusable.yml
# virtual-board entries (already prepared, commented out) once the old
# published artifacts age off the mirror.
nanopi-r6s
nanopi-r6c
nanopi-m6
nanopct6
nanopct6-lts
